<!--
  The mark: a document page with its top-right corner sliced off at 45 degrees.
  40 x 54 dp, 14 dp chamfer, 3 dp corners, centred on the visible area.

  The viewport is 108 to match the adaptive canvas. Do not shrink it to 72: the
  foreground is drawn into the full 108 dp and only *clipped* to the inner 72 dp
  when presented, so a 72 viewport zooms the page by 1.5.
-->
